   "handle": "project-skin-complete-4-step-skincare-routine-kit",
   "title": "Project Skin Complete 4-Step Skincare Routine Kit",
   "body_html": "<h2><span class=\"s1\"><b>Your Complete Routine. One Beautifully Simple Kit</b></span></h2>\n<p class=\"p2\">Clearer, calmer, healthier-looking skin starts with a routine you can actually follow.</p>\n<p class=\"p2\">The <span class=\"s1\"><b>Project Skin Complete 4-Step Routine</b></span> brings together everything you need for your everyday skincare ritual \u2014 thoughtfully designed to <span class=\"s1\"><b>cleanse, treat, hydrate and protect</b></span>.</p>\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>4 Steps. One Complete Routine.</b></span></h3>\n<p class=\"p2\"><b>01 \u2014 CLEANSE</b><br><span class=\"s1\"><b>Refreshing Cleanser \u00b7 120 ml</b></span><br>Gently cleanses away impurities and excess oil while helping keep pores clear.<br><span class=\"s1\"><i>2% Salicylic Acid \u00b7 Ceramides \u00b7 Hyaluronic Acid</i></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><b>02 \u2014 TREAT</b><br><span class=\"s1\"><b>Blemish Recovery Serum \u00b7 30 ml</b></span><br>Targeted care for blemishes, excess oil and uneven-looking skin.<br><span class=\"s1\"><i>5% Niacinamide \u00b7 Zinc PCA</i></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><b>03 \u2014 MOISTURIZE</b><br><span class=\"s1\"><b>Calming Moisturizer \u00b7 60 g</b></span><br>Replenishes hydration and helps support a healthy, comfortable skin barrier.<br><span class=\"s1\"><i>Ceramide Complex \u00b7 Hyaluronic Acid</i></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><b>04 \u2014 PROTECT</b><br><span class=\"s1\"><b>Protecting Sunscreen SPF 50 PA++++ \u00b7 60 g</b></span><br>Broad-spectrum UVA + UVB protection for your essential final morning step.<br><span class=\"s1\"><i>Hyaluronic Acid \u00b7 Niacinamide</i></span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><b>Simple skincare. Thoughtfully put together.</b></span></h3>\n<p class=\"p3\"><b>CLEANSE \u2192 TREAT \u2192 MOISTURIZE \u2192 PROTECT</b></p>\n<p class=\"p2\">Four essentials. One effortless routine.<br><span class=\"s1\"><b>Your journey to clear, calm &amp; confident skin begins here.</b></span></p>",
