   "handle": "clear-seal",
   "title": "Clear Seal Next-Gen Liquid Patch Technology - Acne Prone Skin",
   "body_html": "<p data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2807\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Experience the future of targeted acne care with <strong data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2622\">Project Skin Clear Seal</strong>. This advanced liquid patch is engineered to create an invisible, breathable seal that protects blemishes from external aggressors while supporting the skin's natural recovery process.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"3207\">Enriched with <strong data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2841\">Salicylic Acid</strong> to gently exfoliate and refine pores, and <strong data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2899\">Niacinamide</strong> to visibly calm and strengthen the skin barrier, Clear Seal delivers effective care without the visibility of traditional patches. The quick-drying formula provides all-day comfort with a weightless finish, making it an effortless addition to your daily skincare routine for clearer, healthier-looking skin.</p>",
