   "title": "Active Boba Encapsulated Cream - Acne Prone Skin",
   "body_html": "<p><span>Project Skin Active Boba Encapsulated Cream is an advanced acne-care formulation powered by visible encapsulated active beads that burst upon application to deliver fresh actives directly into the skin. Formulated with Niacinamide, Zinc PCA, Salicylic Acid, and botanical extracts, it helps control excess oil, reduce breakouts, refine pores, and support a clearer-looking complexion.The lightweight cream is enriched with hydrating and skin-repairing ingredients like Hyaluronic Acid, Ceramide-supporting phospholipids, Aloe Vera, and Centella Asiatica to help maintain skin balance without over-drying. The encapsulated technology improves ingredient stability and ensures effective delivery for smoother, healthier-looking skin.</span></p>",
